# Real secrets that live beside maintained source, never in it.
# `.agents/secrets/pipeline.env` is the pipeline's own secret file that the
# skill scripts and `tool-jubian` resolve by walking up from the workspace, so a
# copy can appear in any project directory. The XHS runtime holds live browser
# cookies and account backups. Neither is ever source.
.agents/secrets/
.xiaohongshu-runtime/
.credentials.yaml
# Machine-local scratch beside this checkout (migration ledgers, draft plans).
/.local/
# Generated residue: a full coverage dump, and a stray file literally named `-`.
cov-all.txt
/-
# VitePress writes a timestamped copy of the site config while building.
*.timestamp-*.mjs
